# NAME: AcademicPlatforms
# AUTHOR: UykiZhao
# REPO: https://github.com/UykiZhao/Clash-Party-Override-Rule
# UPDATED: 2026-09-22
# PURPOSE: International academic platforms -> proxy. Mirrors the
#          academic_platforms inline ruleset of the Clash YAML overrides.
#          Must be placed BEFORE the China lists: scopus.com, clarivate.com,
#          engineeringvillage.com, sciencedirect.com, annualreviews.org,
#          siam.org and ams.org appear in upstream China domain sets, and
#          would otherwise be misrouted to DIRECT.

# 检索、索引、DOI 与科研身份
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,scholar.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,semanticscholar.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,scopus.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,webofscience.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clarivate.com
